# Copy to .env. Nothing here is required to boot; uncomment what you need.
#
# Unprefixed vars are read by apps/server in dev (`wrangler dev
# --env-file ../../.env`). VITE_ vars are read by apps/tanstack and apps/nextjs
# through Vite's `envDir`, inlined at build time. apps/nextjs also inlines
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* the Next way.
#
# Deployed values never live here: non-secrets go in the app's config, secrets
# through the deploy CLI.

# apps/server, non-secret. Also add it to wrangler.jsonc "vars" when deployed.
# EXAMPLE_PUBLIC_VAR=

# apps/server, secret. `wrangler secret put EXAMPLE_SECRET` when deployed.
# EXAMPLE_SECRET=

# apps/tanstack and apps/nextjs, public and build-time. In apps/tanstack,
# declare it in src/env.d.ts first.
# VITE_PUBLIC_VAR=

# apps/nextjs, public and build-time. vinext inlines it the Next way.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_VAR=

# D1 needs no credentials here: each CLI applies migrations through its own login.
